    "name": "Unsafe Express",
    "steam_appid": 1756160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/0bd59b473246be0a2d02d539e414a45a.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> Hastur Industries</i> <i>is hiring!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our forces and experience a unique adventure throughout space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore new worlds and meet new beings, all while (sometimes) getting paid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/d3511369b3cd36d583b8f26d7219955f.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/d3511369b3cd36d583b8f26d7219955f.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/d3511369b3cd36d583b8f26d7219955f.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/aa20e5ab3f1a8fa5a97a454d3610126b.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b1c990cf67a1ebe9ad32ab89baf7a58f.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b1c990cf67a1ebe9ad32ab89baf7a58f.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b1c990cf67a1ebe9ad32ab89baf7a58f.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the terminal to <i>navigate</i> the galaxy with the company's interstellar train. Access various space stations full of materials, mysterious lifeforms and other horrors that lurk in the dark corners of humanity's ever-reaching grip into the darkness of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/8443e6e099551a9b25301801aea73338.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/90e190b740b64521bba79f4f7554a29c.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/90e190b740b64521bba79f4f7554a29c.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/90e190b740b64521bba79f4f7554a29c.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gather</i> the necessary materials for your mission, but remember; you are not alone  out there... There are many entities out there who seek to curb humanity's progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/73de01e4db0b577f469f416aa1a8112c.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b2176c6aca323d5899f9aabc0ec52d98.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b2176c6aca323d5899f9aabc0ec52d98.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b2176c6aca323d5899f9aabc0ec52d98.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell materials to <i>complete</i> your mission. Earn some profit on the side and remind yourself how lucky you are to work for a company that values profit over human life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/8b4513821f3550de18101258962f2a93.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take note, you must fulfill each mission within 3 days. Plan your space station exploration carefully! Failure to deliver your quota and your future with Hastur Industries may come into question. There are always more like you, who will continue the holy work of capitalism should you fail however, so have fun, and may the force of profit be with you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/ab3e23065a329c3f3fe488cdbe707938.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/ab3e23065a329c3f3fe488cdbe707938.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/ab3e23065a329c3f3fe488cdbe707938.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/1511613a456f88c063034fb9fd3c8052.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 1-4 PLAYER ONLINE COOP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> MANY TOOLS AND ITEMS TO CHOOSE FROM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> YOU MUST PET THE CAT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> TRAUMATIC EXPERIENCES WITH ALIEN LIFEFORMS (BONUS!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> CREATIVE WAYS TO DIE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> NOT SO MANY CREATIVE WAYS TO KILL</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/9cd9cd176f28cb1ccbdfafd28eeb7a88.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/9cd9cd176f28cb1ccbdfafd28eeb7a88.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/9cd9cd176f28cb1ccbdfafd28eeb7a88.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/5c22a1cccd054a1730e18009bcdd4a4c.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/0bd59b473246be0a2d02d539e414a45a.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> Hastur Industries</i> <i>is hiring!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our forces and experience a unique adventure throughout space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore new worlds and meet new beings, all while (sometimes) getting paid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/d3511369b3cd36d583b8f26d7219955f.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/d3511369b3cd36d583b8f26d7219955f.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/d3511369b3cd36d583b8f26d7219955f.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/aa20e5ab3f1a8fa5a97a454d3610126b.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b1c990cf67a1ebe9ad32ab89baf7a58f.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b1c990cf67a1ebe9ad32ab89baf7a58f.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b1c990cf67a1ebe9ad32ab89baf7a58f.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the terminal to <i>navigate</i> the galaxy with the company's interstellar train. Access various space stations full of materials, mysterious lifeforms and other horrors that lurk in the dark corners of humanity's ever-reaching grip into the darkness of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/8443e6e099551a9b25301801aea73338.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/90e190b740b64521bba79f4f7554a29c.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/90e190b740b64521bba79f4f7554a29c.webm?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/90e190b740b64521bba79f4f7554a29c.mp4?t=1733399056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Gather</i> the necessary materials for your mission, but remember; you are not alone  out there... There are many entities out there who seek to curb humanity's progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/73de01e4db0b577f469f416aa1a8112c.webp?t=1733399056\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756160/extras/b2176c6aca323d5899f9aabc0ec52d98.poster.avif?t=1733399056\" ><source src=\"https://shared